--TEST--
an attribute nothing declares is offered a declaration at file scope, on the site it is used on, with a field for each key the use writes, typed from its value, `rule:ide/a-code-action-writes-only-what-is-already-determined`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Mailer
{
    #[<|>Job(queue: "mail", retries: 3, delay: 1.5, tags: ["a", "b"], urgent: true)]
    public function send(): void {}
}

new Mailer()->send();
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
1:6-1:6 quickfix Declare the attribute -> "\n\nattribute Job on method { queue: string, retries: int, delay: float, tags: array<string>, urgent: bool }\n"
